WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.303
Look — spin the character in the cockpit and it renders front, side, back, all of it.

00:00:05.303 --> 00:00:08.721
But every single one of those frames is an inference call.

00:00:08.721 --> 00:00:12.138
The more you spin, the more smoothly your bill grows too.

00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:15.674
Wait — is the meter spinning faster than the propeller right now?

00:00:15.674 --> 00:00:18.856
And crucially, this cockpit only flies on someone else's engine.

00:00:18.856 --> 00:00:21.213
So just plug the engine into our own rack?

00:00:21.213 --> 00:00:24.041
Now what's spinning is our GPU, not the meter.

